<main id="main" class="ct-page ref-page">
<div class="ct-wrap">
<nav class="ref-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Contact</li></ol></nav>
<header class="ref-head">
  <span class="hero-ornament"></span>
  <h1 class="research-title">Write to the Institute</h1>
  <p class="ref-lede">Corrections, ideas, questions and proposals all reach the research team. Tell us what your message is about and we will take it from there.</p>
</header>

<div class="ct-layout">
  <section class="ct-main" aria-label="Contact form">
    <form class="ct-form" id="ct-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mpqkezdj" method="POST" novalidate>
      <fieldset class="ct-topics">
        <legend class="ct-step"><span class="ct-num">1</span> What is your message about?</legend>
        <div class="ct-topic-grid">
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="correction"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20h4L19 9l-4-4L4 16z"/><path d="M13.5 6.5l4 4"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Correct an error</span><span class="ct-td">A wrong date, name, place or fact on one of our pages</span></label>
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="suggest"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4"/><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5 1 1.2 1 2.1h5c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.1A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Suggest a topic</span><span class="ct-td">A state, empire, person or theme we should cover</span></label>
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="write"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 4c-6 0-12 4-14 12l-2 4"/><path d="M8 14c4 0 8-2 10-6"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Write for us</span><span class="ct-td">An article, an essay idea, or joining as a contributor</span></label>
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="data"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="1"/><path d="M4 10h16M4 15h16M10 4v16"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Our data and images</span><span class="ct-td">Reusing, citing or licensing what we publish</span></label>
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="press"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 10v4h3l6 4V6L7 10z"/><path d="M16.5 9a4 4 0 0 1 0 6"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Press and partnerships</span><span class="ct-td">Media, collaborations, schools and events</span></label>
          <label class="ct-topic"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="other"><span class="ct-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/></svg></span><span class="ct-tt">Something else</span><span class="ct-td">Questions, feedback, or just to say hello</span></label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="ct-details">
        <p class="ct-step"><span class="ct-num">2</span> <span id="ct-step2">Your message</span></p>
        <p class="ct-hint" id="ct-hint">Choose a topic above, or simply write to us.</p>
        <div class="form-row" id="ct-page-row" hidden>
          <label class="form-label" for="ct-page">Page with the error</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="ct-page" name="page" type="text" placeholder="the page address, e.g. /encyclopedia/battle-of-hastings">
        </div>
        <div class="ct-two">
          <div class="form-row">
            <label class="form-label" for="ct-name">Name <span class="form-required">*</span></label>
            <input class="form-input" id="ct-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name">
            <p class="ct-err" id="ct-name-err" hidden>Please tell us your name.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <label class="form-label" for="ct-email">Email <span class="form-required">*</span></label>
            <input class="form-input" id="ct-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="your@email.com">
            <p class="ct-err" id="ct-email-err" hidden>We need a valid email address to reply.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label class="form-label" for="ct-message">Message <span class="form-required">*</span></label>
          <textarea class="form-input form-textarea ct-message" id="ct-message" name="message" placeholder="Write your message…"></textarea>
          <p class="ct-err" id="ct-message-err" hidden>Your message is a little short: a sentence or two helps us help you.</p>
        </div>
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" class="ct-hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" id="ct-subject" value="Message — The Epoch Institute">
        <div class="ct-send-row">
          <button type="submit" class="form-submit ct-send" id="ct-send">Send message &rarr;</button>
          <p class="ct-privacy">We use your email only to reply to you.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="ct-status" id="ct-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="ct-done" id="ct-done" tabindex="-1" hidden>
      <span class="ct-done-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
      <h2 class="ct-done-title" id="ct-done-title">Thank you</h2>
      <p class="ct-done-text" id="ct-done-text">Your message is with the research team.</p>
      <p class="ct-step ct-step-sm">While you wait</p>
      <ul class="ct-next">
        <li><a href="/atlas"><b>The Atlas</b><span>See the world in any year</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/quiz"><b>Today's quiz</b><span>Four clues, four guesses</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/today-in-history/"><b>On this day</b><span>What happened today in history</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <form class="ct-nl" id="ct-nl" novalidate>
        <label class="form-label" for="ct-nl-email">Get the monthly digest</label>
        <div class="ct-nl-row"><input class="form-input" id="ct-nl-email" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" autocomplete="email"><button type="submit" class="form-submit">Subscribe</button></div>
        <p class="ct-status" id="ct-nl-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="ct-side">
    <div class="ct-card">
      <h2 class="ct-card-title">Write to us directly</h2>
      <dl class="ct-mails">
        <dt>Research and corrections</dt><dd><span class="ct-mail">research@the-epoch-institute.org</span><button type="button" class="ct-copy" data-copy="research@the-epoch-institute.org">Copy</button></dd>
        <dt>Partnerships and outreach</dt><dd><span class="ct-mail">outreach@the-epoch-institute.org</span><button type="button" class="ct-copy" data-copy="outreach@the-epoch-institute.org">Copy</button></dd>
        <dt>Events and information</dt><dd><span class="ct-mail">info@the-epoch-institute.org</span><button type="button" class="ct-copy" data-copy="info@the-epoch-institute.org">Copy</button></dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-card">
      <h2 class="ct-card-title">Follow the Institute</h2>
      <ul class="ct-social">
        <li><a href="https://x.com/Epoch_Institute" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X <span>@Epoch_Institute</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/the.epoch.institute/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram <span>@the.epoch.institute</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/the.epoch.institute" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook <span>The Epoch Institute</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-card ct-faq">
      <h2 class="ct-card-title">Before you write</h2>
      <details><summary>How do I cite a page?</summary><p>Encyclopedia, state, country and century pages end with a &#8220;Cite this&#8221; box in APA, MLA, Chicago and Harvard style, ready to copy.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I reuse your pictures?</summary><p>Our pictures come from Wikimedia Commons under free licences. The author and licence are shown under each one: reuse them on those terms.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I use your data?</summary><p>Yes. The states register and the power curves are free to reuse under CC BY 4.0: see <a href="/dataset">Open Data</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What happens to a correction?</summary><p>We check it against our sources and, if it holds, correct the page. Each page shows when it was last reviewed.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I write for the Institute?</summary><p>Yes: send a finished article to the <a href="/community#submit">Community</a> pages, or <a href="/contributors">apply to join</a> as a contributor.</p></details>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
</div>
</main>

